#: ../../tools/intogen_tools.rst:32 2e4f4c37ef6f4aedb2fe301cb64765d5
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get cancer driver genes for a specific cancer type from "
"IntOGen. Returns genes identified as drivers by computational methods "
"(dNdScv, OncodriveFML, OncodriveCLUSTL, HotMAPS, smRegions, CBaSE, "
"MutPanning) applied to somatic mutation data from thousands of tumors. "
"Each result includes the gene symbol, number of mutations and mutated "
"samples across cohorts. Use IntOGen\\_list\\_cancer\\_types to see "
"available cancer type codes. Example: cancer\\_type='BRCA' returns 118 "
"driver genes for breast cancer including TP53, PIK3CA, GATA3."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/intogen_tools.rst:34 ../../tools/intogen_tools.rst:65
#: ../../tools/intogen_tools.rst:96 ../../tools/intogen_tools.rst:125
