#: ../../tools/intogen_tools.rst:36 b9f224dd34bb4e259cc0b4966d02c08d
msgid ""
"``cancer_type`` (string) (required) IntOGen cancer type code. Examples: "
"'BRCA' (breast), 'LUAD' (lung adenocarcinoma), 'COADREAD' (colorectal), "
"'AML' (acute myeloid leukemia), 'SKCM' (melanoma), 'GBM' (glioblastoma). "
"Use IntOGen\\_list\\_cancer\\_types to see all available codes."
msgstr ""

