#: ../../tools/intogen_tools.rst:94 3a983d1ef06e46a6ba34900fcd39e2ba
msgid ""
"**Description**: List all 87 cancer types available in IntOGen with their"
" codes and full names. Returns cancer type identifiers (e.g., BRCA, LUAD,"
" COADREAD, AML, SKCM) that can be used with IntOGen\\_get\\_drivers and "
"IntOGen\\_list\\_cohorts. IntOGen covers 87 cancer types spanning solid "
"tumors, hematological malignancies, and pediatric cancers."
msgstr ""

